        <briefdescription>
<para>Binds a lambda function to instantiate an instance of class T. Also binds another lambda function for destroying the instance of <ref refid="struct_a_g_e_1_1_widget" kindref="compound">Widget</ref>. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The first lambda function creates a new instance of class T and casts it to ScriptableWidget*. The second lambda function deletes the instance of <ref refid="struct_a_g_e_1_1_widget" kindref="compound">Widget</ref>, then sets its Instance pointer to nullptr.</para>
<para>Binds a lambda function to create an instance of type T and another lambda function to destroy it.</para>
